  "instance_name": "antisemitic_stereotype",
  "label": "Antisemitic Stereotype: 'Jew in the Oven'",
  "description": "This is a historically rooted antisemitic trope that depicts Jews as being metaphorically or literally locked in an oven, often used to evoke imagery of persecution, genocide, or dehumanization. The meme weaponizes this stereotype by associating it with the Muppet character Ernie, creating a jarring and hateful juxtaposition. This trope is deeply tied to the Holocaust and has been used to incite hatred against Jewish people.",
